  data: {
    LLM: "1. Players take turns playing one card from hand to the table. 2. If the played card matches the value of a card on the table, the player captures both cards. 3. Multiple cards can be captured if their values sum to the played card's value. 4. If no capture is possible, the card remains on the table. 5. After playing, players draw a replacement card from the stock if available.",
    Player: "1. Players take turns playing one card from hand to the table. 2. If the played card matches the value of a card on the table, the player captures both cards. 3. Multiple cards can be captured if their values sum to the played card's value. 4. If no capture is possible, the card remains on the table. 5. After playing, players draw a replacement card from the stock if available.",
    objective: 'Capture cards from the table by matching their values. Score points for capturing specific cards (Kings, the 7 of Coins, etc.) and for capturing the most cards overall.',
    gameplay: "1. Players take turns playing one card from hand to the table. 2. If the played card matches the value of a card on the table, the player captures both cards. 3. Multiple cards can be captured if their values sum to the played card's value. 4. If no capture is possible, the card remains on the table. 5. After playing, players draw a replacement card from the stock if available.",
